# Conformance probe pack for an inner message in one kind of an outer pack
# (spec 0.34), most significant bit first. Public.
#
#   byte 0      the outer kind: 7 = carry, 8 = plain
#   kind carry  n in 8 bits, then one conformance-inner-seq message to the end
#   kind plain  w in 8 bits
format     conformance-inner-kinds
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
kind carry
when     8  7
requires probe.n
field    probe.n  8  uint
inner    conformance-inner-seq
kind plain
when     8  8
requires probe.w
field    probe.w  8  uint
